  Featuring Rebecca Romijn, Blac Chyna, Camila Mendes, Madelaine Petsch, Odette Annable and Nina Dobrev
 Written & Directed by Langan Kingsley</div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/2KitkZ0</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[DarthPutinKGB]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>Ok last pic for this Pink Wednesday</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/i1XYNr3</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/uQVS4Ld.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>I finally went out to see a former co-worker and drove my newly purchased car on the freeway. My god the freedom to move when you want whenever you want must not be taken for granted. Anyway she is an older lady in her 60's, super sweet, takes the bus to work duper hardworking even though she has a hard time walking so I was delighted to pick her up and finally catch up with her. We just discussed so much and cried and laughed and went to Michaels to look at crafts and then Walmart as she wanted to make a lemon blueberry cake (never thought I'd say I missed Walmart.) It was so nice to feel normal and independant again and she was so happy to see me and be driven somewhere. 

I know I am repetative but my gratitude for what you all did to help get me back here and start over and BELIEVED in me and my crazy story I can never thank you enough.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/P7mQ82a.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>I found this cute plush throw at Burlington to cover my backseat and bring me some joy. I MEAN LOOK HOW FREAKING CUTE IT IS!!! It was the last one for $9.99 so I had to get it. My little treat for the month. 

I hope you all find something to make you smile or sparkle this week and the holiday season to come.

*Edit: I STILL AM BANNED FROM CHAT AND NO REPLY TO MY APPEALS. I will post more about my Halloween and Christmas card giveaway in the days and weeks to come on my other account.</div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/i1XYNr3</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[princesscindycat]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>U_U</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/eTF7wJa</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/8ph5O2h.png" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/eTF7wJa</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[ProppaGanda]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>Erika’s a failure lol</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/1NDSrE9</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/PgS2tKN.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>https://www.salon.com/2026/09/08/why-erika-kirk-failed-as-turning-point-usas-leader/</div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/1NDSrE9</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[wadatahmydamie]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>He tried his best to build an accessible guitar</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/gloVmnc</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/xvY6Lx9.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Asfvision is Anthony S. Ferraro, he advocates for less sighted people by doing skateboarding, sports, and arts. Nvision guitars specializes in building custom guitars for people with less sight, including tactile fret markers, textured knobs, and ergonomic bodies. 

https://nvisionguitarsllc.square.site/

By engineering for those with less abilities and resources, we end up finding universal aids that help everyone. As a guitarist, I know many of us would love tactile necks to not look down as much, if we play live in the dark, and just to learn without visually checking which frets we are on. 

Not an ad, no association with either party in this video, just sharing the love</div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/gloVmnc</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[StellaMatutina]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>Hugs</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/icugjQJ</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/KAuSHT4.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/icugjQJ</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[DOcelot1]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>I don't know about that</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/AlizmEy</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/uxJHsco.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/AlizmEy</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[majortool]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>Keeping little bro warm</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/dtDz3Jx</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/AYThB9z.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/dtDz3Jx</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Edu2026]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>For an encore he did "Down With the Sikhness"</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/6DA6qvG</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/brDnaWZ.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Source 

